},{"text":" when its context has no session","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"event_properties"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The event’s stored properties, by name"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"event_type"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The event’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Event\/name"},{"text":", as it is","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"insert_id","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The record’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"EventRecord\/id","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", as a lowercase UUID string; a redelivered record keeps it","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"session_id"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The session’s start in Unix milliseconds, the first 48 bits of its version 7 ","type":"text"},{"code":"SessionKey","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"; left out for a record with no session, or a session key of another version","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"time"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"When the event was tracked, in whole milliseconds since 1970","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The session is the only identifier sent: there is no "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"user_id"},{"type":"text","text":", and no "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ip"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"idfv"},{"type":"text","text":" or other"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"device identifier. Amplitude counts a user per "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"device_id"},{"type":"text","text":", so its unique users are sessions. A"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"record with no session (one tracked by a tracker without "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Enricher.sessions()"},{"type":"text","text":", or one a store"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"recovered after a relaunch, which keeps no context) is its own anonymous user, linked to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"nothing: Amplitude rejects an event with neither a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"device_id"},{"type":"text","text":" nor a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"user_id"},{"type":"text","text":". Amplitude drops"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a second copy of an event with the same "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"insert_id"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"device_id"},{"type":"text","text":", so a recovered record that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Amplitude had already stored under its session, before the app ended, is stored again. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"record’s vendor identifier and trace context, and any other context value, aren’t sent. Nor is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ip"},{"type":"text","text":": neither an address nor "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"$remote"},{"type":"text","text":", which asks Amplitude to look the user’s location up"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from the request’s address."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Properties are read through the event’s schema in ","type":"text"},{"code":"plan","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", as ","type":"text"},{"code":"PropertyReader","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" reads them. A","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Sensitive","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" value is never sent, whatever the record reveals: the property is left","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"out, an element of an array is ","type":"text"},{"code":"null","type":"co